{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボンジュール( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま！\nモバメで報告しましたが、パリから戻って参りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのフランスは、街が素敵でパンが美味しくて22時なのに外は明るかったりフランスの人は温かくてとにかく...街が素敵だったりと満喫してきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャパンエキスポでは、たくさんの声援をもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちのこと知ってもらえてるか正直不安だったけど、乃木坂って名前はフランスにも知ってもらえてて嬉しかったよ！いや、ほんとに！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくの初海外ライブだったので、少しでも乃木坂を広められてればいいなと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉はなかなか通じなかったけど、気持ちで一つになれた気がしたよ(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また海外でライブができるように、たくさん頑張ろうって思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメが大好きな生駒ちゃんやさゆりんは、興奮して終始(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))こんな感じで可愛かった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は9枚目シングル発売日！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの手元にはもうあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PVですが、全国の吉田様、すみません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が演じたミキちゃんは、何もかも完璧で結構強い女だったのですが、あんなにドエスな感じに言葉を口にして言うことがないので...なんだか楽しかったよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気で笑って本気で怒って、色んな白石...いや、黒石かもしれません...が、見れると思うので是非ともご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、Secret Honeyのカタログ撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわふわなお洋服をたくさん着て気分もふわふわ〜( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成が楽しみです！\nよかったら見てねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨はいやだね。ジメジメは嫌いよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張ろう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2014/07/10/5391172/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メルシー(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}